cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CoCoFold2, please cite the CoCoFold2 manuscript and this software release."
title: "CoCoFold2: scalable latent refinement of diffusion-based protein structure predictions from limited-particle cryo-EM data"
type: software
version: "2.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: Liao
    given-names: Junwen
  - family-names: Hu
    given-names: Mingxu
  - family-names: Bao
    given-names: Chenglong
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/jwliaomath/CoCoFold2.git"
abstract: >-
  CoCoFold2 is a deterministic experimental refinement framework that couples
  a frozen Protenix-style protein diffusion prior to cryo-EM particle
  observations through target-specific latent and auxiliary renderer-parameter
  optimization.
